  "highlights": [
    "Set up Antigravity — Switchboard detects the Antigravity app and CLI, installs its MCP connection, and provides a manual setup snippet. Update all and Remove handle every existing configuration location, so an older connection is not left behind.",
    "More useful controls in the native tray menu — right-click the menu-bar icon for Quick Access to services that need attention and those already running. Your monitored-service selection can include stopped services too. View All Services shows the total configured count and opens the full list, including missing services. Service submenus offer approved Start actions for stopped services and Stop/Restart for running or degraded services, and Settings is available directly from the menu.",
    "Lifetime updates and support have no end date — Lifetime licenses now include ongoing updates and support without an expiry date."
